Subject: [PATCH] feat: Witch's Potion quest
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Problem. Witch's Potion (Hetty, Rimmington) was not implemented.

Change. New quest. Progress is varp 67 (hetty) through a server-only
varbit: 0, 1 started, 2 ingredients given, 3 complete (drunk from the
cauldron), the values Quest Helper reads. Dialogue follows the OSRS Wiki
transcript, including the player's line for every combination of held
ingredients. The hand-in takes one of each in one transaction and shows
the transcript's single message box; drinking from the cauldron shows its
line as a message box, then completes the quest. Rewards: 1 QP, 325 Magic
XP. Hetty's after-quest lines move from the Rimmington townsfolk script
into the quest.

The rat's tail drops for the killer from every standard rat the wiki
lists (regular and Stronghold of Security rats, dungeon rats, the level-26
Stronghold giant rats) while the quest is in progress. It comes from an
NpcDeathKillHook on the quest's own stage, not a drop-table quest gate:
under the default quest-requirements mode (assume-completed) an
in-progress gate never passes, so a table entry would make the quest
uncompletable on a default server. The hook reads the real stage, so the
drop works in every mode.

Tests. WitchsPotionInteractionTest (9): start, decline and witch topic,
partial ingredients, the hand-in (one of each taken, stage 2), the
hand-in as one message box, the cauldron before the hand-in, drinking (a
message box, stage 3), the tail from every listed rat id only while the
quest is in progress (none before, none from a regular giant rat, none
after completion), and the ingredient line wording.

Data sources. OSRS Wiki: Witch's Potion, Transcript:Witch's Potion,
Transcript:Hetty, Rat's tail (item sources; "100% chance to drop once you
begin the quest"; unobtainable after completion), Rat (ids 2854, 2855,
2492, 2513), Dungeon rat (2865-2867, 3607-3609), Giant rat (level 26,
2510-2512). Quest Helper WitchsPotion (varp 67 steps, cauldron loc 2024).
Cache npc names and ids.

Caveats. The tail also drops at stage 2 (ingredients given, not yet
drunk): the wiki says only "during the quest". Rat 13624 (rat_lowwander)
is not in the wiki's rat ids and does not drop it. The journal text, the
quest scroll item, chathead expressions and the cauldron line after
completion are guesses.

